WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
A list is a box of items, and an item can hold another list

2
00:00:05.076 --> 00:00:07.526
&lt;ul&gt; opens a box for a list.

3
00:00:08.302 --> 00:00:11.402
Each &lt;li&gt; is one item, inside the list.

4
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.890
The closing U L tag ends the list.

5
00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:19.540
&lt;ol&gt; makes a numbered list. The browser does the counting.

6
00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:24.796
An item is a box, so a whole list can go inside it.
